WEBVTT

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:02.880
My name is Taiki Kudou.

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:06.450
I was taken to this mysterious 
place called the Digital World,

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:08.120
where I met Shoutmon

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:10.790
and the other creatures of 
this world, called Digimon.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:14.910
This world is having a lot of trouble

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:17.330
with the attacking Bagra Army.

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:20.660
Thanks to Zenjirou's efforts,

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:22.780
we saved the Monitamons 
of the Shinobi Zone,

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:26.090
and added Nene and the 
Monitamons to our ranks,

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.350
making our team even stronger!

00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:38.000
<b>A Zone Collapses!</b>

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:38.000
<b>Sparks Fly Between Taiki and Kiriha!</b>

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:36.640
A Zone Collapses! Sparks Fly 
Between Taiki and Kiriha!

00:00:57.940 --> 00:00:59.710
We've won this fight.

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:02.440
Hand over the symbol 
of this Zone's ruler.

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:04.690
I have lost.

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:07.370
Take the Code Crown.

00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:10.130
Sir Mercurymon...

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:13.250
Now I have 12 Code Crowns.

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:15.890
I've got 22!

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:19.870
How many does that make?

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:21.610
34.

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:24.400
I knew you'd get it, blue General.

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:34.640
Th-The Bagra Army!

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:37.020
I realized that

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:39.360
if I defeat you or the red General,

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:42.480
I'll get lots more Code Crowns instantly.

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:44.250
I challenge you!

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:47.420
The winner gets all the 
Code Crowns? Not bad.

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:49.090
I accept your challenge,

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:51.690
Blastmon of the Three Head Officers!

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:56.490
This is getting out of hand!

00:01:58.090 --> 00:02:01.470
It's lonely with Nene off 
working on her own...

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:02.860
We can't help it.

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:05.910
She's trying to find out 
where her brother is.

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:09.150
Oh, it's the next Zone!

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:17.180
There are discs all over the place!

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:19.020
You're right...

00:02:19.620 --> 00:02:21.380
This is the Disc Zone.

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:22.620
Disc Zone?

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:27.960
It's a world made up of countless 
layers of these giant light discs.

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:31.330
What's wrong?

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:35.150
My shoulders have felt so stiff lately.

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:36.000
Are you that old?

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.900
Hey!

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:41.010
Hey! You Digimon, over there!

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:44.510
Oh! Hey! We're...

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:45.710
Hit the deck!

00:02:57.930 --> 00:02:59.720
We landed right in a war zone?!

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:01.720
This Zone is done for!

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:03.700
Look over there!

00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:07.000
The Bagra Army and Kiriha?!

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:20.210
You're not half bad.

00:03:20.210 --> 00:03:22.750
This is the best the Three 
Head Officers can do?

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:25.380
What was that, you scrawny blond runt?!

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:27.240
Please calm down!

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:30.050
If you can defeat him, you will...

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:32.790
...rise to the top of 
the Three Head Officers!

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:34.790
Hey, you're right!

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:36.130
Okay, then!

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:50.060
This isn't good!

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:52.010
If we get dragged into 
that, we're finished!

00:03:52.010 --> 00:03:54.610
Final...

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:58.850
Subagon Punch!

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:05.560
That's the worst attack 
name I've ever heard.

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:08.060
Deckerdramon, lend me your strength.

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:09.990
Understood, Kiriha.

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:13.630
MetalGreymon!

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:16.930
Deckerdramon!

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:20.870
DigiXros!

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:27.110
DeckerGreymon!

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:30.520
Resorting to a DigiXros because 
you know you can't win, eh?

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:32.480
Do it.

00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:39.960
What is that?

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:43.460
Cyber Blader!

00:04:57.050 --> 00:04:59.680
That is some DigiXros...

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:03.980
DeckerGreymon?

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:09.790
Kiriha is getting stronger and stronger.

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:13.930
Oh, no!

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:16.190
The mountain is collapsing!

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.580
Now the rest of them are falling, too!

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:21.870
What's going on?!

00:05:22.350 --> 00:05:24.060
The Disc Zone is ancient and deteriorating.

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:26.440
It's very susceptible to 
shocks and vibrations!

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:27.040
What?!

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:30.510
You little...

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:36.910
If they keep this up, 
our Zone will fall to pieces!

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:38.320
Let's stop them!

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:42.660
What is the leader of this Zone 
doing at a time like this?!

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:48.170
Our leader, Sir Mercurymon, 
was defeated by the blue General.

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:51.400
What? So the new leader 
of the Zone is...

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:52.730
Kiriha?!

00:05:54.930 --> 00:05:57.610
Very nice, DeckerGreymon.

00:06:02.030 --> 00:06:03.470
You can push as hard as you want!

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:05.280
It doesn't hurt or even itch!

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:07.600
Now <i>that</i> itches!

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:09.800
This isn't the season 
for mosquito bites!

00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:11.700
Taiki!

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:13.800
You have to stop fighting, Kiriha!

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:16.720
If you keep going, this Zone 
will crumble to pieces!

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:19.660
We'll help you! Let's just 
beat him and get it over with!

00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:21.380
Your help is not needed.

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:22.660
What?

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:25.750
It's as DeckerGreymon says, Taiki.

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:27.870
Even if it's you...

00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:30.440
I won't let anyone 
interfere in my fight.

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:31.190
Kiriha!

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:33.940
Taiki!

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:38.040
Well dodged.

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:39.230
Kiriha!

00:06:39.230 --> 00:06:40.550
Have you lost your mind?

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:43.080
Move, Taiki.

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:46.820
<i>That's the nasty side I 
see in Kiriha sometimes.</i>

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:51.310
<i>Like something dark is welling 
up from deep in his heart.</i>

00:06:53.070 --> 00:06:56.640
Don't forget me... I'm always...

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:59.800
...right here!

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:03.430
Guard, X4K!

00:07:03.430 --> 00:07:03.980
Right!

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:11.610
Wh-What's going on?

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:12.950
X4K!

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:20.520
The DigiXros dissolved!

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:23.520
Crystal Breath!

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:26.990
Plasma Deckerdra-launcher!

00:07:33.630 --> 00:07:36.400
Oh, no! More mountains are collapsing!

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:38.340
What?

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:44.210
Lord Blastmon!

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:46.060
At this rate, I'll land on my...

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:47.070
...head!

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:50.880
I didn't get his Code Crowns.

00:07:52.270 --> 00:07:53.690
Greymon!

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:56.920
Shoutmon!

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:28.700
Shoutmon!

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:33.720
It's no use. He's not answering.

00:09:33.720 --> 00:09:36.150
This happened because you butted in.

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:37.260
Kiriha...

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:39.900
Never interfere in my battles again.

00:09:39.900 --> 00:09:41.830
Next time, you won't get away with it.

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:45.040
What are you talking about?!

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:46.410
If you had just stopped fighting,

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:49.290
your Digimon wouldn't have fallen!

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:49.700
But still you—

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:53.810
Is this Zone going to be okay?

00:09:56.580 --> 00:09:58.050
Shoutmon...

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:10.660
There's no way to climb up that...

00:10:13.930 --> 00:10:14.980
No good?

00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:16.640
My wings are damaged.

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:20.060
I can't recover without returning 
to Kiriha's Xros Loader.

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:21.650
Hey, you guys!

00:10:21.650 --> 00:10:23.970
Oh, you're still here, shrimp?

00:10:24.340 --> 00:10:26.000
Since we're stuck here,

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:29.130
why don't we help each other?

00:10:29.130 --> 00:10:31.740
Help each other?

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:35.260
Do you have the strength to help us?

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:36.720
Of course!

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:40.390
I'm the guy who's gonna 
be the Digimon King!

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:46.270
What's so funny?!

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:48.780
You calling yourself a King.

00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:52.750
You couldn't even help the Digimon 
you were just DigiXrosed with.

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:55.020
You don't mean...

00:10:56.620 --> 00:10:59.770
Our DigiXros dissolved because of me?

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:01.010
Most likely.

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:05.200
You have neither the strength nor 
the spirit to maintain a DigiXros.

00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:08.980
You are not fit to be the central 
support for your allies.

00:11:11.740 --> 00:11:13.590
Not fit...

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:24.590
So you just picked on Blastmon a little,

00:11:24.590 --> 00:11:26.590
and he ran off to fight?

00:11:26.590 --> 00:11:28.270
He's no good!

00:11:28.270 --> 00:11:30.600
<i>What's "no good" about me?!</i>

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:34.940
<i>You have the fewest Code Crowns 
of all the Three Head Officers.</i>

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:37.440
<i>S-So you found out...</i>

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:39.430
<i>Your only choice is to steal the</i>

00:11:39.430 --> 00:11:41.610
<i>Code Crowns that the Generals have.</i>

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:45.750
<i>Hey! That's a surprisingly good idea!</i>

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:48.370
But I doubt he can do it. He's no good.

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:52.570
You're quite interesting. 
Seems keeping you was the right decision.

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:56.960
I hope he manages to destroy himself.

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:05.240
Shh! You mustn't speak, Chuchumon!

00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:15.720
If this keeps up, 
the whole Zone will fall apart!

00:12:15.720 --> 00:12:17.880
What do we do, Taiki?

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:20.830
Kiriha, can't you save 
this Zone from collapsing

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:23.110
with your Code Crown?

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:25.620
Why should I do that?

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:27.760
To save your friends!

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:29.890
Besides, this is your Zone now, right?

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:33.870
Isn't it a given that you should 
protect the Digimon living here?

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:44.540
You weaklings and your 
tears make me sick!

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:46.080
Kiriha!

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.150
Remember this, Taiki.

00:12:49.150 --> 00:12:52.600
I'm collecting Code Crowns so that

00:12:52.600 --> 00:12:55.870
I can remake the Digital 
World the way I want it.

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:58.720
And what I want is a world 
where only the strong live.

00:12:58.720 --> 00:13:00.690
Losers just get in the way.

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:04.650
Only the strong should survive.

00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:07.790
If Greymon and MailBirdramon 
can't climb up here on their own,

00:13:07.790 --> 00:13:09.000
that's the end for them.

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:10.770
That's...

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:13.270
That's wrong!

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:18.230
Stop it!

00:13:19.340 --> 00:13:20.480
Akari...

00:13:31.210 --> 00:13:33.580
I threw around too many 
crystals in that fight.

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.440
Now I'm hungry.

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:38.460
And here I am stuck by my head. 
I guess I'll go home for today.

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:42.230
I'll let my most powerful 
reinforcements take over.

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:51.070
What is that?

00:13:51.070 --> 00:13:52.910
That's Bulbmon of the Bagra Army!

00:13:53.300 --> 00:13:55.210
And he's huge!

00:13:55.210 --> 00:13:58.850
He's going to destroy them 
in Lord Blastmon's place!

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:01.630
Knightmon, stop his movements!

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:03.050
Understood!

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:04.310
Knight!

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:06.320
Pawn!

00:14:08.390 --> 00:14:10.460
Those jerks, making fun of me!

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:12.230
Like I care what they think!

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:19.000
What an odd place for a hidden door.

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.120
Look.

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:26.520
That must be an elevator system.

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:41.230
Jeez! How many times 
do you have to fall?!

00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:42.730
Shrimp!

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:46.340
Don't be reckless. You'll fall, too.

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:48.930
Don't underestimate me! This is nothing!

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:50.450
Just let go. You can't do it.

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:52.970
I can!

00:14:52.970 --> 00:14:54.410
You can't!

00:14:56.020 --> 00:14:58.140
I told you...

00:14:58.140 --> 00:15:00.960
I can!

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:08.290
I did it...

00:15:08.690 --> 00:15:10.140
This runt...

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:12.020
He pulled us both up together...

00:15:12.980 --> 00:15:16.080
Still think I'm not fit to help?

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:17.830
I'll say it one more time.

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:21.070
Let's work together!

00:15:23.140 --> 00:15:25.020
You should learn your place.

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:31.080
This guy's a real pain.

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:34.380
And neither of us have the Digimon 
our DigiXroses are based on!

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:39.310
If this keeps up, the Zone 
will continue to collapse.

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:55.600
Sorry to keep you waiting, Taiki!

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:56.900
Shoutmon!

00:15:57.710 --> 00:15:59.550
He's back!

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:04.250
I'm so glad you're okay!

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:05.310
Of course I am!

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:07.640
Sorry, Kiriha.

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:09.210
Took you long enough.

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:10.950
But now I can finally...

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:11.880
Wait, Kiriha!

00:16:12.210 --> 00:16:14.480
Don't damage the Zone any further!

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:17.050
We'll handle this fight our way!

00:16:18.180 --> 00:16:20.190
Fine. Just try it.

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:37.840
Shoutmon!

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:39.980
Okay!

00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:41.010
Ballistamon!

00:16:43.110 --> 00:16:44.310
Dorulumon!

00:16:46.550 --> 00:16:48.050
Starmons!

00:16:48.050 --> 00:16:49.140
Yes!

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:51.820
Knightmon!

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:53.100
Knight!

00:16:53.100 --> 00:16:54.220
PawnChessmons!

00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:55.190
Pawn!

00:16:55.190 --> 00:16:56.960
DigiXros!

00:16:56.960 --> 00:16:58.750
DigiXros!

00:16:59.970 --> 00:17:03.350
Shoutmon X4K!

00:17:16.110 --> 00:17:20.490
X4K! Try to fight so you 
don't damage the ground!

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:23.860
So I can't use my strongest attacks?

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:29.790
That's crazy!

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:32.060
If he holds back, he'll be killed!

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:35.370
This is a one-sided match.

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:39.390
Darn it...

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:42.910
Not yet!

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:46.780
Try to hang in there, my DigiXr—

00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:49.650
X4K!

00:17:49.650 --> 00:17:52.310
Now! Stomp him flat!

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:55.740
X4K!

00:17:59.070 --> 00:18:00.490
Greymon!

00:18:04.260 --> 00:18:06.820
Where's the strength you had

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:09.070
when you threw us over 
your head, shrimp?

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:12.170
<i>Throw... That's it!</i>

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:15.630
Greymon, help me push this jerk down!

00:18:15.630 --> 00:18:16.970
Don't order me around.

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:22.610
But... if you insist, 
I suppose I can give you a hand.

00:18:22.610 --> 00:18:24.050
Please.

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:28.950
It looks like something's 
wrong with his foot.

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:30.220
Let's go!

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:55.050
Victorize Boomerang!

00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:06.120
All right!

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:07.790
He's been defeated!

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.340
Run!

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:11.590
Greymon.

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:14.470
I only returned a favor to him.

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:20.510
You all tried your best,

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:22.560
but it's too late for this Zone.

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:38.190
It can't be...

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:39.940
Too bad.

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:43.230
If you think you can save all 
these Digimon, be my guest.

00:19:43.230 --> 00:19:44.450
Kiriha!

00:19:45.340 --> 00:19:48.900
Kiriha, I don't hate you,

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:51.240
but I don't agree with 
the world you desire.

00:19:51.240 --> 00:19:54.630
It's since they're weak that 
I can't turn my back on them!

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:57.620
I'd rather live in a world where the 
strong and weak help each other!

00:19:58.320 --> 00:20:01.470
Then you'll just have to stop me...

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:02.610
by force.

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:07.260
Taiki!

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:09.130
What do we do, Taiki Kudou?!

00:20:09.130 --> 00:20:11.290
The Zone is going to fall apart!

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:18.440
